            "action_description": {
              "value": "Requirements: The bloodseeker is attached to a creature.\n\nThe bloodseeker uses its proboscis to drain blood from the creature it's attached to. This deals 1d4 damage, and the bloodseeker gains temporary Hit Points equal to the damage dealt. A creature that has its blood drained by a bloodseeker is drained 1 until it receives healing (of any kind or amount)."
